Material Estimation – 2BHK Residential Building

1. Project Details

Project: 2BHK Residential Building
Plot Size: 30 ft × 40 ft
Proposed Building Footprint: 24 ft × 30 ft
Building Footprint Area: 720 sq.ft

2. Floor Tile Estimation

Total Listed Room Area = 560 sq.ft

Assumed Tile Wastage = 5%

Tile Quantity = 560 × 1.05

= 588 sq.ft

3. Material Requirement

Material| Estimated Quantity| Unit
Floor Tiles| 588| sq.ft
Tile Adhesive| As per manufacturer coverage| Bags
Tile Grout| As per manufacturer coverage| kg
Cement for other works| Not calculated| Bags
Sand for other works| Not calculated| CFT

4. Calculation

Basic Tile Area = 560 sq.ft

Wastage = 560 × 5 / 100

= 28 sq.ft

Total Tile Requirement = 560 + 28

= 588 sq.ft

5. Important Notes

1. This is an educational preliminary estimate.
2. Actual tile quantity depends on the final architectural layout.
3. Door openings, tile sizes and cutting patterns must be considered.
4. Structural material quantities require approved structural drawings and specifications.

6. Conclusion

Estimated Floor Tile Requirement = 588 sq.ft.

